{
  "$comment": "SAHOOL canonical indicators registry (WS-B.1) — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for indicator metadata. Consolidates the previously scattered catalogs: services/sahool-platform/api/analytics_shapers.py:_INDICATOR_CATALOG + _BAND_MATH, services/raster-service/raster_quality.py:INDICATOR_FORMULAS, services/raster-service/raster_provenance.py:INDICATOR_FORMULA_VERSION, services/vegetation-analysis-service/vegetation_runtime.py:_RASTER_REAL_INDEX (real-vs-estimated aliasing), frontend/src/lib/layerRegistry.ts:LAYER_REGISTRY (kind='index'), frontend/src/sections/HybridIndexPage.tsx:INDICATOR_CATALOG. HONESTY CONTRACT: 'source' truthfully labels real (raster-service Sentinel-2 formula) vs estimated (vegetation synthetic bands) vs derived (formula over weather/ledger inputs); an estimate is NEVER labelled real. GUARD: scripts/ci/indicators_registry_gate.py statically cross-checks this file against the scattered catalogs and FAILS CI on drift. This increment adds NO HTTP endpoint and does NOT modify analytics_shapers/routers/frontend — registry file + gate only.",
  "$fields": {
    "id": "canonical indicator id (matches raster-service index= param / catalog id)",
    "source": "real = raster-service per-pixel Sentinel-2 formula | estimated = vegetation-analysis synthetic-band estimate | derived = deterministic formula over weather/ledger/sensor inputs",
    "status": "implemented = real path served today | estimated = honest estimate served today | not_implemented = declared but real computation absent",
    "computation.formula_ref": "dotted ref into a source-of-truth formula map, e.g. raster_quality.INDICATOR_FORMULAS.ndvi (checked by the guard)",
    "computation.raster_alias": "the real raster index a vegetation id is bridged to via _RASTER_REAL_INDEX (savi->msavi, ndmi->moisture)",
    "renderable": "true = raster-service produces a colored tile layer present in frontend layerRegistry kind='index'"
  },
  "guard": "scripts/ci/indicators_registry_gate.py",
